Mirobody public genotype examples

The HG00096/HG00097 genotype calls come from the open 1000 Genomes phase 3
resource maintained by IGSR. The twelve GRCh37 regional extract SHA-256
digests, the public X subset digest, and the exact selected calls are in
manifest.json and canonical.json. Source directory:
https://ftp.1000genomes.ebi.ac.uk/vol1/ftp/release/20130502/
IGSR data use: https://www.internationalgenome.org/data/

The one no-call row from Harvard PGP file 4220 is openly shared under the
participant's public-data consent. Only that rsID, position and no-call are
included; the original personal export is not distributed here.
https://my.pgp-hms.org/user_file/download/4220
https://pgp.med.harvard.edu/about

Dual-build positions, REF/ALT and gene symbols for the thirteen autosomal
sites are checked against the bundled public dbSNP 155 Common site index.
The catalog's separate NOTICE records its UCSC/NCBI source and coverage.

Vendor-shaped text/CSV and compressed VCF files are renderings of those
unchanged public calls. A filename or header that resembles a vendor export
does not mean the vendor supplied or endorsed the example.
